          "name": "In Flags",
          "type": "UInt",
          "default": "CTF_Default"
        },
        {
          "name": "In Alpha Override",
          "type": "TArray<uint8>*",
          "default": "nullptr"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "UTextureCube*",
      "docs": "Utility for creating a new UTextureCube from a UTextureRenderTargetCube\n@param InOuter - Outer to use when constructing the new UTextureCube.\n@param InNewTextureName - Name of new UTextureCube object.\n@param InObjectFlags - Flags to apply to the new UTextureCube object\n@param InFlags - Various control flags for operation (see EConstructTextureFlags)\n@param InAlphaOverride - If specified, the values here will become the alpha values in the resulting texture\n@return New UTextureCube object."
